<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Invicta raises interim shr, div.</title>
<headline>Invicta raises interim shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Sept 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     26.0	  vs  15.6</p>
<p>    Shr, diluted (cts)    22.6	  vs  12.9</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  6.0	  vs   4.0</p>
